      "present": true,
      "formula": "OpenAI continuous-usage completion_tokens per covered measured window; an exact process-global vLLM counter may replace it only with the explicit --isolated-server all-traffic-authority assertion",
      "notes": "Duration-based steady-state cell after warmup. This is the main tuning/regression signal for kernels, NCCL, DCP, MTP, and scheduling. Client/server token disagreement is invalid by default. SSE chunk rate is transport diagnostics only and cannot supply token throughput. Context sharing is controlled by --unique-context-percent: one scout warms stream 0, then each worker diverges at the requested suffix boundary."
    },
